OL,3,GNorth East
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FStaying dry
OL,6,Fwith patchy cloud, a fresh breeze
OL,7,Finitially though the evening easing
OL,8,Fovernight. Feeling cold, with a risk
OL,9,Fof frost across particularly the south
OL,10,Fof the region. Some patchy fog also
OL,11,Fpossible by dawn.
OL,12,
OL,13,CSunday:FA dry start, frosty in places.
OL,14,FCloud will thicken from late morning,
OL,15,Fbringing rain into the afternoon and
OL,16,Fevening. Milder by day but turning
OL,17,Fcold once again overnight.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
